standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20240904__20240904_zKhjPD0YyQu6"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-09-04" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

